      DIRECTION CONTRACT — /spacesight2/
      THESIS: the page is SpaceSight's own field manual — the product audits SOP
        compliance and operational procedure, so the surface takes the form of the
        procedure document its buyer lives inside. Refuses the standard
        hero-plus-alternating-features landing grid.
      OWN-WORLD: company blue #2563EB on vacuum white, Poppins throughout —
        display, body, doc-control, figure captions, and spec data. Figure
        plates with mono caption strips, ledger hairlines, stamp-style result
        lines, fore-edge tab rail.
      STORY: an operations leader reads cover (offer + proof) → three procedures
        (audit, flow, act) → why footage is not intelligence → deployment hardware
        → four-step rollout → trust and compliance → FAQ → book a demo.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: doc-control strip across the top (DOC SS-OPS-01 · REV
        2026.09 · FIELD MANUAL), title block left with blue-highlighted key
        phrases, FIG.00 plate right (AI Audit capture), proof ledger below,
        Book a Demo primary + See Use Cases ghost.
      FORM: field manual / spec-sheet — candidate 4 of the grounded list, seed
        key 77fc822f; acetate-tab challenger fused as the fore-edge tab rail.
