="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn></div></div></div></section><!-- ================= PART 01 · OPERATING PROCEDURES ================= --><section class="section section-tint ss2-part" aria-labelledby="ss2-part1" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="container" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-part-head" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h2 class="ss2-h2" id="ss2-part1" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>One Platform for Insight and Action</h2></header><!-- PROC A --><article class="ss2-proc" id="proc-a" data-tab="proc-a" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-proc-copy" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-proc-head" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h3 class="ss2-h3" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Audit Every Site Consistently</h3></header><p class="ss2-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Replace manual checks with consistent, visual compliance workflows.</p><p class="ss2-mon-label" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Monitor standards such as:</p><ul class="ss2-checks" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Queue conditions</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Cleanliness</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Display execution</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Safety procedures</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Merchandising</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>SOP compliance</li></ul><p class="ss2-mon-tail" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Across every site, every day.</p></div><figure class="ss2-plate ss2-fig" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-plate-media ss2-fig-media" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><video src="https://whale-web.meetwhale.com/video/Coffee_Spill_Detect.mp4" poster="assets/ss2-audit-demo-poster.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="SpaceSight AI audit demo — ask what needs attention, detect a spill, dispatch the cleanup task" style="aspect-ratio: 1988/1130" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn></video></div></figure></article><!-- PROC B --><article class="ss2-proc ss2-proc-flip" id="proc-b" data-tab="proc-b" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-proc-copy" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-proc-head" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h3 class="ss2-h3" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Understand Customer Movement</h3></header><p class="ss2-mon-label" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>SpaceSight measures:</p><ul class="ss2-chips ss2-chips--measure" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Footfall</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Passerby rate</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Entry rate</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Dwell time</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Conversion</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Queueing</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Traffic patterns</li></ul><p class="ss2-mon-tail" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>By store, zone, or campaign.</p><p class="ss2-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Privacy-conscious video analysis uses non-biometric signals such as body shape, gait, and clothing, not facial recognition.</p><p class="ss2-mon-label" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>These insights help teams improve:</p><ul class="ss2-chips ss2-chips--outcome" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Staffing</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Layouts</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Campaign evaluation</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Store optimization</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Space optimization</li></ul><p class="ss2-mon-tail" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>With real behavioral data.</p></div><figure class="ss2-plate ss2-fig" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-plate-media ss2-fig-media" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><video src="assets/feishu-20260907-145226.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="SpaceSight AI video search demo — ask which stores had abnormal dwell times last week, then review the matched clips" style="aspect-ratio: 1720/1084" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn></video></div></figure></article><!-- PROC C --><article class="ss2-proc" id="proc-c" data-tab="proc-c" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-proc-copy" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-proc-head" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h3 class="ss2-h3" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Turn Insights Into Action</h3></header><p class="ss2-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Spacesight Vega connects analytics with action. Teams can ask operational questions such as:</p><ul class="ss2-queries" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Why did conversion drop yesterday?</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Which stores showed abnormal dwell time?</li></ul><p class="ss2-mon-label" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>SpaceSight acts — automatically:</p><ol class="ss2-chain" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-chain-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>01</span>Retrieves relevant footage</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-chain-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>02</span>Identifies possible root causes</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-chain-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>03</span>Creates work orders</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-chain-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>04</span>Dispatches follow-up tasks</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-chain-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>05</span>Generates operational reports</li></ol><p class="ss2-mon-tail" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Agent orchestration creates a closed operational loop — from detection to resolution.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary ss2-proc-cta" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-中部留资-行动" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Book a Demo</button></div><figure class="ss2-plate ss2-plate-phone" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-plate-media" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><video src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/products/ss2-spaceclaw-app.mp4" poster="https://whale-site.netlify.app/products/ss2-spaceclaw-poster.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="SpaceSight mobile app — Spacesight Vega operational assistant in use" style="aspect-ratio: 456/934" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn></video></div></figure></article></div></section><!-- ================= PART 02 · VISIBILITY ================= --><section class="section ss2-part" id="visibility" data-tab="visibility" aria-labelledby="ss2-vis-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="container" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-part-head" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h2 class="ss2-h2" id="ss2-vis-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>From Passive Cameras to Actionable Operations</h2></header><div class="ss2-vis-grid" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><figure class="ss2-plate" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="ss2-plate-media" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><video src="https://whale-web.meetwhale.com/video/Abnormal_Dwell_Time_Search.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="SpaceSight platform demo — natural-language video search across cameras" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn></video></div></figure><div class="ss2-vis-copy" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><p class="ss2-lede" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-lede-dim" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Most monitoring systems only record what happened.</span><br>SpaceSight helps teams understand <strong data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>what is happening, why it matters, and what to do next.</strong></p><p class="ss2-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Built for physical operations intelligence, SpaceSight connects with existing CCTV, AI cameras, sensors, and edge AI devices to turn video and sensor data into real-time insights for:</p><ul class="ss2-vis-outcomes" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Store operations</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Loss prevention</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Compliance</li><li data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Customer experience</li></ul></div></div><aside class="ss2-cta-strip" data-reveal aria-label="Book a demo" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-cta-tag" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Next Step</span><p class="ss2-cta-text" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>See what your existing cameras can tell you.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-中部留资-可视化" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Book a Demo</button></aside></div></section><!-- ================= PART 03 · DEPLOYMENT ================= --><section class="section section-tint ss2-part" id="deployment" data-tab="deployment" aria-labelledby="ss2-dep-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="container" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-part-head" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h2 class="ss2-h2" id="ss2-dep-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Hardware Built for Every Deployment</h2><p class="ss2-body ss2-part-lede" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Whether you're installing new cameras or upgrading the intelligence of an existing CCTV network, our hardware gives you the flexibility to deploy AI where it matters.</p></header><div class="ss2-hw-cards" data-reveal><article class="ss2-hw-card"><div class="ss2-hw-head"><span class="ss2-hw-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="9" width="12" height="8" rx="1.5"/><circle cx="9" cy="13" r="2.2"/><path d="M15 11.3l5-1.8v7l-5-1.8"/><path d="M18.6 2.8l.55 1.5 1.5.55-1.5.55-.55 1.5-.55-1.5-1.5-.55 1.5-.55z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><h3>AI Cameras</h3></div><div class="ss2-hw-gallery"><img src="assets/hw-cam-dome.png" alt="Dome AI camera" loading="lazy"><img src="assets/hw-cam-recessed.png" alt="Recessed-mount AI camera" loading="lazy"><img src="assets/hw-cam-ptz.png" alt="PTZ AI camera" loading="lazy"></div><p>Purpose-built cameras with onboard AI processing for new or upgraded zones.</p><div class="ss2-hw-ideal"><p class="ss2-hw-ideal-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 1 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>Ideal for:</p><ul><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>New sites</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>New coverage areas</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Camera replacement</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Edge AI deployments</li></ul></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary ss2-hw-cta" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-部署硬件-AI Cameras">Explore AI Cameras <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></article><article class="ss2-hw-card"><div class="ss2-hw-head"><span class="ss2-hw-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="1.5"/><rect x="10.2" y="10.2" width="3.6" height="3.6" rx="0.5"/><path d="M9.5 7V4m2.5 3V4m2.5 3V4M9.5 20v-3m2.5 3v-3m2.5 3v-3M7 9.5H4m3 2.5H4m3 2.5H4M20 9.5h-3m3 2.5h-3m3 2.5h-3"/></svg></span><h3>AI Hubs</h3></div><div class="ss2-hw-gallery"><img src="assets/hw-hub-edge.png" alt="Edge AI Hub" loading="lazy"><img src="assets/hw-hub-fanless.png" alt="Fanless AI Hub" loading="lazy"></div><p>Already have CCTV, NVR, or VMS infrastructure? AI Hubs bring edge AI processing to your existing video streams — without requiring a complete camera replacement.</p><div class="ss2-hw-ideal"><p class="ss2-hw-ideal-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 1 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>Ideal for:</p><ul><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Existing CCTV</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Large-scale deployments</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Camera retrofits</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5.5"/></svg>Mixed infrastructure</li></ul></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary ss2-hw-cta" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-部署硬件-AI Hubs">Explore AI Hubs <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></article></div><h3 class="ss2-steps-h" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Deployment and Continuous Optimization</h3><ol class="ss2-steps" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li class="ss2-step" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-step-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Step 1</span><span class="ss2-step-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Assess</span><p class="ss2-step-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Review site layout, camera coverage, network readiness, priority use cases, and success metrics.</p></li><li class="ss2-step" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-step-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Step 2</span><span class="ss2-step-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Connect</span><p class="ss2-step-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Use existing CCTV, NVR, or VMS where possible, and add AI Hub or Edge AI Cameras where needed.</p></li><li class="ss2-step" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-step-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Step 3</span><span class="ss2-step-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Configure</span><p class="ss2-step-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Set up camera channels, AI models, zones, thresholds, and business rules.</p></li><li class="ss2-step" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-step-no" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Step 4</span><span class="ss2-step-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Optimize</span><p class="ss2-step-body" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Validate with real site footage, monitor system health, and fine-tune settings over time.</p></li></ol><aside class="ss2-note" data-reveal aria-label="Deployment guidance" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-note-tag" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Note — Deployment Guidance</span><div class="ss2-note-text" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><p class="ss2-note-q" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Not sure what your site needs?</p><p class="ss2-note-a" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Book a demo and we will help assess your deployment path.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary ss2-note-btn" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-部署咨询留资" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Book a demo</button></aside></div></section><!-- ================= PART 04 · TRUST ================= --><section class="section ss2-part" id="security" data-tab="security" aria-labelledby="ss2-sec-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><div class="container" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><header class="ss2-part-head" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><h2 class="ss2-h2" id="ss2-sec-h" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Security, Privacy, and Compliance by Design</h2></header><div class="ss2-ledger ss2-ledger-trust" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><p class="ss2-ledger-head" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Provision</span><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>What it means</span></p><div class="ss2-ledger-row" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-ledger-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>No Facial Recognition</span><span class="ss2-ledger-desc" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>People tracking uses non-biometric re-identification signals, not facial recognition.</span></div><div class="ss2-ledger-row" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-ledger-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Edge AI Processing</span><span class="ss2-ledger-desc" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Video can be processed locally on AI Hub or Edge AI Camera. Only metadata, analytics, and anomaly events need to be sent to the cloud, reducing bandwidth use by up to 80%.</span></div><div class="ss2-ledger-row" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-ledger-name" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Enterprise-Grade Standards</span><span class="ss2-ledger-desc" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Certified and audited against the standards enterprise IT and legal teams ask for.</span></div></div><ul class="ss2-certs" data-reveal data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><li class="ss2-cert" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><img src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/cert-logos/soc2-shield.png" alt="SOC 2 Type II" width="120" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>SOC 2 Type II</span></li><li class="ss2-cert" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><img src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/cert-logos/gdpr-badge.png" alt="GDPR Compliant" width="120" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>GDPR Compliant</span></li><li class="ss2-cert" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><img src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/cert-logos/iso-27001-badge.png" alt="ISO 27001 Certified — Information Security Management" width="120" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>ISO 27001 Certified</span></li><li class="ss2-cert" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><img src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/cert-logos/iso-27701-badge.png" alt="ISO 27701 Certified — Privacy Information Management" width="120" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>ISO 27701 Certified</span></li><li class="ss2-cert" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><img src="https://whale-site.netlify.app/cert-logos/hipaa-badge.png" alt="HIPAA Compliant" width="120" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>HIPAA Compliant</span></li></ul><aside class="ss2-cta-strip" data-reveal aria-label="Book a demo" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><span class="ss2-cta-tag" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Next Step</span><p class="ss2-cta-text" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Ready to see it work on your sites?</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-中部留资-信任" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>Book a Demo</button></aside></div></section><!-- ================= USER CASES ================= --><section class="section ss2-part" id="cases" data-tab="cases" aria-labelledby="ss2-case-h"><div class="container"><header class="ss2-part-head" data-reveal><h2 class="ss2-h2" id="ss2-case-h">User Cases</h2></header><div class="case-grid ss2-case-grid" data-reveal><article class="case-card"><div class="case-visual"><img src="assets/case-watsons.png" alt="Watsons storefront inside a shopping mall" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="case-body"><div class="ss2-case-meta"><img class="ss2-case-logo-img" src="assets/case-watsons-logo.png" alt="Watsons"><span class="ss2-case-brand">Watsons × Whale</span></div><h3 class="ss2-case-title">Enabling Precision Marketing Across Watsons’ Physical Stores</h3><p class="ss2-case-industry">Beauty &amp; Personal Care</p></div></article><article class="case-card"><div class="case-visual"><img src="assets/case-nio.png" alt="NIO ES8 smart electric SUV" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="case-body"><div class="ss2-case-meta"><img class="ss2-case-logo-img" src="assets/case-nio-logo.png" alt="NIO"><span class="ss2-case-brand">NIO × Whale</span></div><h3 class="ss2-case-title">Creating and Sharing a Better Way of Life</h3><p class="ss2-case-industry">Automotive</p></div></article><article class="case-card"><div class="case-visual"><img src="assets/case-colmo.png" alt="COLMO AI-powered home appliance store" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="case-body"><div class="ss2-case-meta"><img class="ss2-case-logo-img" src="assets/case-colmo-logo.png" alt="COLMO"><span class="ss2-case-brand">COLMO × Whale</span></div><h3 class="ss2-case-title">End-to-End Store Digitalization for an AI-Powered Home Appliance Brand</h3><p class="ss2-case-industry">Consumer Electronics &amp; Home Appliances</p></div></article></div></div></section><!-- ================= FAQ ================= --><div data-tab="faq" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><section class="section section-tint" id="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><div class="container" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><div class="section-head center" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><h2 class="hero-shimmer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Everything you need to know about SpaceSight before scaling across your sites.</p></div><div class="faq-list" data-collapsed data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>01</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>What is SpaceSight?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>SpaceSight is Whale&#39;s spatial intelligence and AI-audit platform that transforms camera footage into structured metrics, real-time alerts, and operational workflows. It is far more than a basic people-counting tool, delivering end-to-end spatial analytics, safety checks, multi-site benchmarking, and automated evidence review across your physical operations.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>02</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>How is ROI measured?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>ROI is measured by tangible business outcomes—such as labor hours saved, faster issue closure, and reduced shrink—rather than raw detection volume alone. By connecting real-time AI alerts directly to your daily operations, value is generated through optimized staffing, improved customer experience, and higher multi-site compliance.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>03</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Do you use facial recognition? What are you actually capturing?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>No, SpaceSight does not use facial recognition or identify individual customers by name. Instead, our platform uses anonymous Person Re-Identification (ReID) to convert foot traffic and spatial activity into privacy-compliant metadata, supported by encryption, role-based access, and optional video masking.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>04</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Does our video leave the building, and where does the data live?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>No, continuous raw video remains securely on your local NVR network and never leaves your facility. Primary AI processing occurs locally on an on-premises AI Hub, transmitting only lightweight analytics metadata and approved evidence snapshots to the cloud using enterprise-grade encryption.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>05</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Can we use our existing cameras?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>In most cases, yes, as SpaceSight is designed to layer directly onto your existing IP cameras and NVR streams via an AI Hub. During onboarding, our team conducts a quick technical assessment to verify stream stability, camera angles, and lighting before recommending any minor adjustments or hardware additions.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-extra data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>06</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>How is this different from our existing CCTV system?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>While traditional CCTV acts as a passive recording tool for manual incident review, SpaceSight transforms your camera network into an active operational intelligence system. It automatically analyzes video streams in real time to generate automated alerts, predictive insights, and semantic search capabilities without requiring you to replace your current hardware.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-extra data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>07</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>How accurate is SpaceSight?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Because AI precision depends on site-specific variables like lighting and camera angles, we establish custom performance baselines rather than offering a generic universal figure. We collaborate with your team to define exact success criteria and validate model accuracy against human-verified ground truth before full deployment.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-extra data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>08</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Pilot: How long, how many sites, and what does it cost?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Pilots typically run for 2 to 4 weeks at a single flagship site, focusing on 1 to 2 priority use cases before scaling to a multi-site rollout. Commercial pricing is fully customized based on your required AI Hub hardware capacity, annual software licensing, installation, and specific workflow integrations.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item" name="faq" data-extra data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><summary class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><span class="faq-number" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>09</span><span class="faq-text" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>What are our key responsibilities during deployment?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-iapfl64i><p data-astro-cid-iapfl64i>Your team and local integrators manage physical site readiness, network access, cabling, and day-to-day alert reviews. Whale handles the pre-installation site survey, AI Hub configuration, model calibration, continuous platform maintenance, and ongoing technical support.</p></div></details></div></div></section></div><!-- ================= CLOSING ================= --><section class="section section-dark cta-section" id="contact"><div class="container cta-container"><div class="cta-layout"><div class="cta-copy"><h2>Physical Operations Intelligence for Better Compliance and Store Performance.</h2><p class="cta-lead">See what your existing cameras can tell you.</p><div class="cta-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-large" data-open-modal data-source-type="spacesight2页-底部留资">Book a Demo</button></div></div><div class="cta-visual" aria-label="SpaceSight product demo"><img class="cta-video" src="assets/cta-dome.jpg" alt="SpaceSight dome AI camera" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></section><!-- fore-edge tab rail (inside .ss2 for token scope) --><nav class="ss2-tabs" aria-label="Manual sections" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn><a href="#cover" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="cover" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>COVER</a><a href="#proc-a" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="proc-a" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>A·AUDIT</a><a href="#proc-b" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="proc-b" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>B·FLOW</a><a href="#proc-c" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="proc-c" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>C·ACT</a><a href="#visibility" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="visibility" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>VISION</a><a href="#deployment" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="deployment" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>DEPLOY</a><a href="#security" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="security" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>TRUST</a><a href="#faq" class="ss2-tab" data-tab-link="faq" data-astro-cid-qo4tvqjn>FAQ</a></nav></main><footer class="h5-footer"><a href="https://www.meetwhale